      "trend": "Researchers have been exploring various methods to reduce the sintering temperature of high-entropy alloys, including mechanical alloying, spark plasma sintering, and laser powder bed fusion. The studies have shown that these methods can lead to improved microstructure, mechanical properties, and corrosion resistance. However, the sintering temperature remains a significant challenge, and reducing it while maintaining the desired properties is an ongoing research goal.",
